type: software
title: "AI Assurance Case Lab"
abstract: "The capstone of a ten-lab series: an assurance case that turns pinned evidence from AI testing labs into one reviewable release argument, with defeaters, residual risks, mappings to NIST AI RMF, ISO/IEC 42001 and the EU AI Act, and checks that test the argument itself."
